ed timestamps in all benchmark result files to reflect\nthe latest runs.\n- Increased runs per tool in buildtool.json and packagr.json for more\nreliable metrics.\n- Updated Angular and related package versions from release candidates\nto stable versions in multiple result files.\n- Improved build times and output sizes for various tools in benchmark\nresults.\n- Adjusted correctness metrics to reflect additional fixtures and\nimproved results.\n- Fixed discrepancies in rendering statistics and entry points for\nvarious tools in e2e and fullapp benchmarks.\n- Enhanced error reporting for ng-cli builds to provide clearer reasons\nfor failures.","tree":{"sha":"1f8011b42f51a6a25accabb92aef4c55d5bdc6c8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/1f8011b42f51a6a25accabb92aef4c55d5bdc6c8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/0b984bd26075c26c891f5ae5ebaf1300ceec6e8a","verification":{"payload":"tree 1f8011b42f51a6a25accabb92aef4c55d5bdc6c8\nparent eb0707d6fe826856f43971cdadfc653c33325958\nparent cd1df0fa892634bdaffedea83acdc97806db1f37\nauthor Jordan Upton <Jordan@libertyware.co.uk> 1780619424 +0100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1780619424 +0100\n\nchore: update benchmark results and configurations (#13)\n\n- Updated generated timestamps in all benchmark result files to reflect\nthe latest runs.\n- Increased runs per tool in buildtool.json and packagr.json for more\nreliable metrics.\n- Updated Angular and related package versions from release candidates\nto stable versions in multiple result files.\n- Improved build times and output sizes for various tools in benchmark\nresults.\n- Adjusted correctness metrics to reflect additional fixtures and\nimproved results.\n- Fixed discrepancies in rendering statistics and entry points for\nvarious tools in e2e and fullapp benchmarks.\n- Enhanced error reporting for ng-cli builds to provide clearer reasons\nfor failures.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE--