ganizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/04114665d95fff8d3d938fe586c8573241bdbb0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:22:31Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:22:31Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"refactor: extract ngx-maintenance to its own repo; delete dead language-tool\n\n- ngx-maintenance: moved to its own repo treatyjs/ngx-maintenance (history\n  preserved via subtree split). Removed from the monorepo (111 files); it was a\n  self-contained Turborepo with no monorepo config references.\n- language-tool/: DELETED (11 files) — the dead 2024 LSP predecessor (last\n  touched 2024-09-26). The CURRENT, actively-developed language service is\n  libs/treaty/lsp (@treaty/lsp — plugin-extensible Volar server backed by the\n  Rust authoring compiler) + libs/treaty/vscode (@treaty/vscode extension), both\n  updated 2026-06-01. Repointed the root build/watch/pack:language scripts from\n  the never-existent ./language-server/vscode to ./libs/treaty/vscode.","tree":{"sha":"f0e21674359799de20cf778945aae11fa156f968","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/f0e21674359799de20cf778945aae11fa156f968"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/04114665d95fff8d3d938fe586c8573241bdbb0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"h