ordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/1c3f55b236ae6410360f1cc7e75bdd5fcfa8ffc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:15:40Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:15:40Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"docs(migration): re-runnable oxc-migration harness (oxc contained behind ParseBackend)\n\nFuture oxc version/API bumps touch only parse/oxc.rs + the oxc Cargo features —\nthe AST->Ivy walk is engine-neutral and the zero-oxc swc backend cross-checks\nbyte-identity. Documents the scout -> bump -> gate (backend-parity + matchGolden\n+ zero-oxc tree) -> baseline path, matching the CI rust-tests gates.","tree":{"sha":"757fe6ced2b27dce058a702d8dfb64c395162963","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/757fe6ced2b27dce058a702d8dfb64c395162963"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/1c3f55b236ae6410360f1cc7e75bdd5fcfa8ffc6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users