/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/183c5020f6fcfe5895c6e2638f1a186860c2639d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:14:11Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:14:11Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"ci: fix napi addon build + add zero-oxc swc gate + Node-24 actions\n\nFixes the two CI failures (NAPI Addon build + Boot gate, same root cause) and\nstrengthens the swc gate now that the zero-oxc backend has landed.\n\nnapi addon (NAPI Addon + Boot gate were red): the build script passed\n`--cargo-cwd ../../.. -p authoring_node`, pointing napi at the VIRTUAL workspace\nroot Cargo.toml (no [package]) -> `Type Error: No package.name field in\nCargo.toml`. CI already runs it with `--cwd libs/authoring/node`, so drop\n--cargo-cwd/-p and let napi read the crate''s own manifest:\n  build       -> napi build --platform --release\n  build:debug -> napi build --platform\nVerified locally: builds authoring_node.node cleanly.\n\nrust-tests: the swc backend is real + byte-identical now, so:\n- backend-parity runs REAL oxc<->swc cross-backend parity (--features oxc,swc):\n  all 29 fixtures byte-identical across both backends (was oxc-vs-oxc).\n- new ZERO-OXC swc gate: build + test treaty_ivy --no-default-features\n  --features swc, assert parse_parity (swc==oxc, 1225/0), and assert\n  `cargo tree --features swc` links ZERO oxc_* crates.\n\nNode runtime: bump actions/checkout + actions/setup-node v4 -> v5 (Node 24)\nacross all workflows to clear the Node-20 deprecation warnings.","tree":{"sha":"9dbb2476bc8878389dca747a3dc9d1b9f6f3e319","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/9dbb2476bc8878389dca747a3dc9d1b9f6f3e319"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/183c5020f6fcfe5895c6e2638f1a186860c2639d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/183c5020f6fcfe5895c6e2638f1a186860c2639d","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDE4M2M1MDIwZjZmY2ZlNTg5NWM2ZTI2MzhmMWExODY4NjBjMjYzOWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/02f9176efd23e56f41a0bbbd09392cf83127f814","sha":"02f9176efd23e56f41a0bbbd09392cf83127f814","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/02f9176efd23e56f41a0bbbd09392cf83127f814"}],"sha":"183c5020f6fcfe5895c6e2638f1a186860c2639d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/183c5020f6fcfe5895c6e2638f1a186860c2639d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/02f9176efd23e56f41a0bbbd09392cf83127f814/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:00:48Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-04T11:00:48Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"refactor: finalize restructure — fix moved-crate workspace paths, REPL Rust-only, drop old TS + lang-treaty\n\nThe rust_authoring crate was moved to libs/authoring/rust in an earlier commit\nbut the workspace member + path deps still pointed at apps/rust/authoring,\nleaving HEAD non-building. This fixes them (root Cargo.toml member +\ntreaty-cli/authoring-node/packagr/ssg-core path deps) so the workspace builds.\n\nAlso completes the old-implementation cleanup:\n- apps/repl treaty-sfc: simplified compiler.ts to the Rust/OXC compiler ONLY,\n  deleted the legacy @angular/compiler TS fallback (treat-to-ivy.ts, printer.ts,\n  html/{parser,tokenizer}.ts, treaty/{lexer,parser,token}.ts).\n- deleted lang-treaty/ (orphaned Lezer .treaty grammar, zero importers).\n\nKEPT (load-bearing / still referenced, not legacy): libs/typescript/vite\n(@treaty/ts-vite — the Rust-NAPI linkPartial shim every bundler imports),\nlanguage-tool/ (the language service + VSCode extension — to be improved next),\nlibs/treaty/edenclient (still referenced by everything-app vite.config +\ntsconfig.base; defer until refs cleaned).\n\nGREEN: cargo build --workspace; rust_authoring 435/0, treaty_packagr 76/0.","tree":{"sha":"d7a2e24ea7cede83b7cf3a111fe08ae65ce5d9d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/d7a2e24ea7cede83b7cf3a111fe08ae65ce5d9d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/02f9176efd23e56f41a0bbbd09392cf83127f814","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/02f9176efd23e56f41a0bbbd09392cf83127f814","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDAyZjkxNzZlZmQyM2U1NmY0MWEwYmJiZDA5MzkyY2Y4MzEyN2Y4MTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/9c14fcd2545aa163eca418ba8b0bdd2f6c036fc1","sha":"9c14fcd2545aa163eca418ba8b0bdd