s","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/24fdf0b85e26e9b382bf5d3b577a7946e0bf9f0e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T08:07:20Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T08:07:20Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(treaty-ivy): partial-mode ɵɵngDeclareComponent/Directive emit — true partial component libraries\n\nCompletes partial mode: a component/directive in compilationMode=partial now emits\nɵɵngDeclareComponent / ɵɵngDeclareDirective from the R3 metadata REUSING the original\ntemplate string (isInline) — NOT a template decompiler — so a partial library is now\nfully declarative (components + directives + the DI/pipe family), matching\nng-packagr''s default instead of leaving components AOT.\n\n- partial_component_emit.rs (new): builds the ɵɵngDeclareComponent object from\n  R3ComponentMetadata + the retained original template (inputs rich-object form with\n  unquoted keys, outputs, host, queries, styles, encapsulation/changeDetection only\n  when non-default, dependencies, isStandalone) — field SHAPE byte-matches a real\n  ng-packagr@21 partial build (vs the tools/angular-ref GOLDEN_PARTIAL.js).\n- mode-gated via CompileOptions; default Full emit byte-UNCHANGED.\n- ROUND-TRIP proven: the partial ɵɵngDeclareComponent output links back through the\n  EXISTING treaty_ivy linker to a valid AOT ɵɵdefineComponent.\n- wired into libs/packagr so partial-mode component libs are true partial.\n\nVerified: matchGolden 185/185 (fresh dump, 0 DIFF), backend-parity 29/29 [oxc,swc],\ntreaty_ivy 133 lib + 12 link_real_packages green.","tree":{"sha":"7a0d7da90986d092d6e4442b278fc0c08474c40e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/7a0d7da90986d092d6e4442b278fc0c08474c40e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/24fdf0b85e26e9b382bf5d3b577a7946e0bf9f0e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/24fdf0b85e26e9b382bf5d3b577a7946e0bf9f0e","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDI0ZmRmMGI4NWUyNmU5YjM4MmJmNWQzYjU3N2E3OTQ2ZTBiZjlmMGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/dfb0e6c74bd0bed36e14efd5f1209bcf766ebf15","sha":"dfb0e6c74bd0bed36e14efd5f1209bcf766ebf15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/dfb0e6c74bd0bed36e14efd5f1209bcf766ebf15"}],"sha":"24fdf0b85e26e9b382bf5d3b577a7946e0bf9f0e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/24fdf0b85e26e9b382bf5d3b577a7946e0bf9f0e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/dfb0e6c74bd0bed36e14efd5f1209bcf766ebf15/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T07:19:38Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T07:19:38Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"ci(bench): standing boot gate — every supported build output must boot\n\nA repeatable gate (tools/treaty-bench/boot-gate.mjs) + CI workflow\n(.github/workflows/boot-gate.yml, on push/PR/dispatch) that builds examples/\nlinker-smoke through vite, rolldown, the native Rust linker, AND ng\n(@angular/build via Architect), headless-boots EACH output, and asserts works=PASS\n(renders, no JIT/@angular/compiler error). Includes the NEGATIVE test — a root\ncomponent with no ɵcmp def MUST boot to works=FAIL (NG0906) — so the gate proves it\ncatches broken output rather than rubber-stamping. Exits non-zero if any real output\nfails to boot OR if the negative test stops failing. Verified: all 4 real outputs\nboot, negative correctly FAILs, and a broken real output produces GATE FAIL exit 1.","tree":{"sha":"f1c7e74e15bc17bfa2a4d502b2f290ed82e2d1bb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/f1c7e74e15bc17bfa2a4d502b2f290ed82e2d1bb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/dfb0e6c74bd0bed36e14efd5f1209bcf766ebf15","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/dfb0e6c74bd0bed36e14efd5f1209bcf766ebf15","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKGRmYjBlNmM3NGJkMGJlZDM2ZTE0ZWZkNWYxMjA5YmNmNzY2ZWJmMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/b6d6a9b26011172161f53dc1c2c5f9e2655f2d29","sha":"b6d6a9b26011172161f53dc1c2c5f9e2655f2d29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/b6d6a9b26011172161f53dc1c2c5f9e2655f2d29"}],"sha":"dfb0e6c74bd0bed36e14efd5f1209bcf766ebf15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/dfb0e6c74bd0bed36e14efd5f1209bcf766ebf15"},{"author":{"ava