Dir),\n  build_imported_selectors(source, projectSelectors), compile_with_registry,\n  compile_many_with_registry — all optional/additive.\n- @treaty/compiler facade: TreatyCompiler.prewarmSelectorRegistry + transform threads\n  an optional per-file importedSelectors.\n- @treaty/vite + @treaty/rolldown: a `selectorRoot` option; buildStart prewarms the\n  project registry once (dev AND build), transform passes per-file selectors.\n\nPROVEN: built examples/ng-bench-app (child uses the non-folding \"app-stat-card\")\nthrough @treaty/vite and headless-booted the dist — the stat cards RENDER (not empty\nhosts). Absent the registry, folding is used → byte-identical (defaults preserved).","tree":{"sha":"71a9470f8ff2ca818903f516e375abfa550954b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/71a9470f8ff2ca818903f516e375abfa550954b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/b6d6a9b26011172161f53dc1c2c5f9e2655f2d29","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/b6d6a9b26011172161f53dc1c2c5f9e2655f2d29","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKGI2ZDZhOWIyNjAxMTE3MjE2MWY1M2RjMWMyYzVmOWUyNjU1ZjJkMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/d7671703e5e4d41a87b30061086fcef92c75dc53","sha":"d7671703e5e4d41a87b30061086fcef92c75dc53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/d7671703e5e4d41a87b30061086fcef92c75dc53"}],"sha":"b6d6a9b26011172161f53dc1c2c5f9e2655f2d29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/b6d6a9b26011172161f53dc1c2c5f9e2655f2d29"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/d7671703e5e4d41a87b30061086fcef92c75dc53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T06:43:55Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T06:43:55Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(packagr): flatten .d.ts re-export barrels (real bug) + esbuild-faithful CSS value minification\n\nIsolated to libs/packagr (treaty_ivy untouched; 185/29 unaffected):\n- dts_flatten.rs (new): a public-api.ts barrel (`export * from ''./lib/x.component''`)\n  previously emitted an index.d.ts with a dangling re-export to a file NOT written to\n  dist → consumer types unresolvable. Now the .d.ts is FLATTENED (the class + ɵfac/\n  ɵcmp declarations inlined into a self-contained index.d.ts, transitively), the\n  d.ts analogue of the existing FESM flatten. VERIFIED: a real `tsc` (6.0.3, strict)\n  consumer importing the packaged lib resolves the types (exit 0, no TS2307).\n- css_optimizer.rs (new): an esbuild-FAITHFUL pure-Rust CSS value minifier (probed\n  esbuild 0.23.1, the build ng-packagr@21 bundles — chose it over lightningcss which\n  over-minifies and would diverge). Covers the common context-free transforms\n  (named-color→shortest-hex in color props, bold→700, hex shorten, 0px→0, .5em\n  normalization, rgb() whitespace), span-rewritten over each compiled `styles:[...]`\n  while preserving the _ngcontent-%COMP% scoping. BYTE-FOR-BYTE equal to a LIVE\n  ng-packagr@21 build on the canonical case. Boundary (3 esbuild micro-opts:\n  shorthand-internal color conversion, transform-fn/selector/at-rule whitespace)\n  documented honestly.\n- Less/Stylus: honest passthrough (no mature pure-Rust engine; SCSS fully via grass).\n- tests/barrel_dts_and_css.rs; treaty_packagr 61 tests green.","tree":{"sha":"e793a2b8bb7544dbbb8bb1c2d09c88cdaeb02b41","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/e793a2b8bb7544dbbb8bb1c2d09c88cdaeb02b41"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/d7671703e5e4d41a87b30061086fcef92c75dc53","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/pr