eived_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/f40c26a46c42e04a3af228d0f0510e5c12e87ea5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T01:34:55Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T01:34:55Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(cli): treaty serve — true module HMR + toggleable dev source maps (matches ng serve DX)\n\nAll in apps/treaty-cli (treaty_ivy untouched — consume-only; 185/29 unaffected):\n- TRUE module HMR: HmrMessage::Update{url,hash} / FullReload over the existing ws.\n  On a file change the watcher recompiles ONLY that module and broadcasts\n  {\"type\":\"update\",url,hash}; the injected client re-imports the new module version\n  (cache-busted) + re-runs its importer chain — NO window.location.reload. Clean\n  full-reload fallback for non-acceptable changes (main.ts / providers). --no-hmr\n  reverts to classic live-reload.\n- TOGGLEABLE DEV SOURCE MAPS: consumes the facade compile_component_source_with_map\n  {code, map}; serves an inline base64 //# sourceMappingURL (default) or an external\n  .map (SourceMapMode), with sources[]/sourcesContent[] = the ORIGINAL authoring\n  file so DevTools shows the .ts/.treaty. ON by default for serve; --no-source-map\n  disables (smaller payloads).\n- Cold-start to first byte stays ~80ms (no regression); 75 cli tests pass incl. an\n  e2e that drives the real notify watcher + asserts HMR-update-not-reload, plus a\n  runnable examples/hmr_maps_demo against ng-bench-app.","tree":{"sha":"28ea92d183d5f7b5cc452748956c543848043b15","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/28ea92d183d5f7b5cc452748956c543848043b15"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/f40c26a46c42e04a3af228d0f0510e5c12e87ea5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/f40c26a46c42e04a3af228d0f0510e5c12e87ea5","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKGY0MGMyNmE0NmM0MmUwNGEzYWYyMjhkMGYwNTEwZTVjMTJlODdlYTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/43bd4df98a00c04fd3a629040b82ce54bbe10873","sha":"43bd4df98a00c04fd3a629040b82ce54bbe10873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/43bd4df98a00c04fd3a629040b82ce54bbe10873"}],"sha":"f40c26a46c42e04a3af228d0f0510e5c12e87ea5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/f40c26a46c42e04a3af228d0f0510e5c12e87ea5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/43bd4df98a00c04fd3a629040b82ce54bbe10873/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T00:57:05Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T00:57:05Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"docs(status): reconcile ranked-DIFF prose to 185/185 (0 DIFF, all closed)\n\nThe table already showed 185/0; the prose still described the 4 NgModule DIFFs as\nby-design. Updated: all 4 closed (jit-mode Inline scope, forwardRef thunk, the\nall-options bug) without regressing the default AOT emit or swc parity.","tree":{"sha":"54151eb628f40514b24941b61e7dbb18c64b905e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/54151eb628f40514b24941b61e7dbb18c64b905e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/43bd4df98a00c04fd3a629040b82ce54bbe10873","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/43bd4df98a00c04fd3a629040b82ce54bbe10873","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDQzYmQ0ZGY5OGEwMGMwNGZkM2E2MjkwNDBiODJjZTU0YmJlMTA4NzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/6930761bb5ac1d650d2173c6e7f1592821b20a0c","sha":"6930761bb5ac1d650d2173c6e7f1592821b20a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/6930761bb5ac1d650d2173c6e7f1592821b20a0c"}],"sha":"43bd4df98a00c04fd3a629040b82ce54bbe10873","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/43bd4df98a00c04fd3a629040b82ce54bbe10873"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/6930761bb5ac1d650d2173c6e7f1592821b20a0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T00:56:00Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T00:56:00Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(treaty-ivy): cross-module selector resolution — real @Component.selector, not class-name folding\n\nAn additive SelectorRegistry (import local name → @Component/@Directive selector)\nthreaded through the compiler, so a template tag resolves to its imported component\nby the component''s REAL selector — fixing the gap where an unmodified Angular-CLI\napp (class StatCard, selector \"app-stat-card\", used as <app-stat-card>) rendered the\nchild as an EMPTY host (it folded to AppStatCard ≠ StatCard).\n\n- compiler (libs/treaty-ivy): optional selector_registry on compile_program_with_source;\n  merge_registry_directives folds each registered import into the selector matcher.\n  Absent the registry it falls back to the class-name↔selector convention →\n  byte-identical (matchGolden 185/185 + swc 29/29 unchanged, re-verified).\n- native CLI (apps/treaty-cli): a two-pass project scan (selectors.rs) builds the\n  registry and supplies it per file in native_build; `treaty build --bundler native`\n  resolves app-* selectors and RENDERS the children (proven on ng-bench-app, whose\n  StatCard now uses the non-folding selector \"app-stat-card\").\n- 4 new registry tests (unresolved-without-registry, resolves-with-registry\n  dependencies:[StatCard], registry=None byte-identical, sibling precedence).\n- STATUS.md headline reconciled 181→185/185 (100%).\n\nHONEST follow-up: the registry is supplied by the native CLI build only; the\n@treaty/vite|rolldown|rspack plugins still fold (they need the same buildStart scan\n+ per-file registry passthrough) — tracked.","tree":{"sha":"9c8c4d7f1906af7badd0d0bb13d4b096e5fc695f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/9c8c4d7f1906af7badd0d0bb13d4b096e5fc695f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/6930761bb5ac1d650d2173c6e7f1592821b20a0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/6930761bb5ac1d650d2173c6e7f1592821b20a0c","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDY5MzA3NjFiYjVhYzFkNjUwZDIxNzNjNmU3ZjE1OTI4MjFiMjBhMGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/5ccc6b300d8208d899616ef24205afc2ef4eb22e","sha":"5ccc6b300d8208d899616ef24205afc2ef4eb22e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/5ccc6b300d8208d899616ef24205afc2ef4eb22e"}],"sha":"6930761bb5ac1d650d2173c6e7f1592821b20a0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/6930761bb5ac1d650d2173c6e7f1592821b20a0c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/5ccc6b300d8208d899616ef24205afc2ef4eb22e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T00:07:56Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T00:07:56Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(cli): native Rust/OXC Angular-CLI — treaty build (1.9×) + treaty serve (59× first-byte) vs ng\n\nA Rust-native CLI (binary `treaty`) that drives the compiler in-process (no NAPI):\n- `treaty build` — Ivy-lowers entries via treaty_ivy directly, links @angular/*\n  partials to AOT, and either drives a bundler plugin (vite/rspack) or a NEW\n  native Rust module-graph bundler (--bundler native: oxc_resolver crawls the\n  static import graph, lowers every first-party .ts, emits a self-contained ESM\n  dist + index.html; 267 modules on ng-bench-app).\n- `treaty serve` — a fully NATIVE dev server (tokio + axum over hyper): compiles\n  each requested .ts/.treaty/.tsx on demand via treaty_ivy (oxc), strips types +\n  rewrites bare specifiers via oxc_resolver, serves native browser ESM, file-watch\n  (notify) + a live-reload websocket. No Node.\n- Existing generate/dev/affected/compile retained.\n\nCLI BENCHMARK vs Angular CLI on examples/ng-bench-app (best-of-3, real, e2e-boot\nWORKS=PASS both): treaty build 2436ms vs ng build 4731ms (1.94× faster; ng dist\nsmaller via its heavier prod optimizer). treaty serve cold→first-byte 80ms + first\n@Component→Ivy module 185ms vs ng serve 4703ms (58.8× faster to first byte — ng\ncompiles the whole app before its first byte). tools/treaty-bench/cli-bench.mjs.\n\ntreaty_ivy untouched (consume-only); cargo test -p treaty_cli 52 pass.","tree":{"sha":"fc662325efaf0173d586f06c435d206a0efade12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/fc662325efaf0173d586f06c435d206a0efade12"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/5ccc6b300d8208d899616ef24205afc2ef4eb22e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/5ccc6b300d8208d899616ef24205afc2ef4eb22e","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDVjY2M2YjMwMGQ4MjA4ZDg5OTYxNmVmMjQyMDVhZmMyZWY0ZWIyMmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/d0fe69d633d0660567dccfc7d11883ee4ecf0ee1","sha":"d0fe69d633d0660567dccfc7d11883ee4ecf0ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/d0fe69d633d0660567dccfc7d11883ee4ecf0ee1"}],"sha":"5ccc6b300d8208d899616ef24205afc2ef4eb22e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/5ccc6b300d8208d899616ef24205afc2ef4eb22e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/d0fe69d633d0660567dccfc7d11883ee4ecf0ee1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T23:24:06Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T23:24:06Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(packagr): toward ng-packagr parity — SCSS styleUrls, full APF, secondary entries, partial ɵɵngDeclare (DI/pipe)\n\nCloses most of the ng-packagr gap; treaty_ivy changes are additive (verified 185/185\nmatchGolden + 29/29 swc unchanged, all suites green):\n- STYLESHEETS: stylesheet.rs resolves @Component styleUrls/styleUrl, compiles SCSS via\n  the pure-Rust `grass` crate, threads through treaty_ivy''s resolved-host channel so\n  the emitter folds + scopes them via the existing ShadowCss port. The Emulated\n  _ngcontent-%COMP% SCOPING is byte-identical to ng-packagr.\n- FESM: fixed resolve_private mangling `.component.ts` stems (with_extension →\n  append), so `public-api.ts` barrels re-exporting `./x.component` now inline.\n- APF: full ng-package.json parsing (inlineStyleLanguage/allowedNonPeerDependencies/\n  flatModuleFile/cssUrl/readmeFile/licenseFile/compilationMode…); ./package.json\n  self-export; glob asset copy + README/LICENSE auto-copy.\n- SECONDARY ENTRY POINTS: verified end-to-end (primary + N secondaries, each own\n  FESM+dts+exports subpath).\n- compilationMode PARTIAL: new treaty_ivy::partial_emit (the inverse of the linker) —\n  inverts the DI/pipe family (ɵfac→ɵɵngDeclareFactory, ɵprov/ɵpipe/ɵinj/ɵmod) to\n  ɵɵngDeclare* via surgical span rewrite; round-trips back to AOT through the existing\n  linker. Mode-gated (default Full unchanged). experimental-local maps to Full.\n\nHONEST gaps (follow-ups, not claimed done): CSS-VALUE optimization (blue vs #00f —\nng-packagr runs esbuild''s optimizer, we don''t yet); .d.ts re-export BARRELS not\nflattened (only index.d.ts written → barrel types unresolvable; ng-packagr uses\nrollup-plugin-dts); partial mode leaves COMPONENTS/DIRECTIVES as AOT (true partial\nneeds a template decompiler); Less/Stylus pass through raw (SCSS fully compiled).\nCorrected the stylesheet.rs doc that overclaimed full byte-equality (only scoping is).","tree":{"sha":"e49f6364cb348f146ab9fab51fd1c8cd7aa6fa9a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/e49f6364cb348f146ab9fab51fd1c8cd7aa6fa9a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/d0fe69d633d0660567dccfc7d11883ee4ecf0ee1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/d0fe69d633d0660567dccfc7d11883ee4ecf0ee1","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKGQwZmU2OWQ2MzNkMDY2MDU2N2RjY2ZjN2QxMTg4M2VlNGVjZjBlZTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/54f5860ceccbb53937087c894178ddd64cb499c6","sha":"54f5860ceccbb53937087c894178ddd64cb499c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/54f5860ceccbb53937087c894178ddd64cb499c6"}],"sha":"d0fe69d633d0660567dccfc7d11883ee4ecf0ee1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/d0fe69d633d0660567dccfc7d11883ee4ecf0ee1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/54f5860ceccbb53937087c894178ddd64cb499c6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T22:08:47Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T22:08:47Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(bench): caveat-free full-app bench — all 6 tools boot; +3 real compiler bugs fixed\n\nThe full pure-Angular app (examples/ng-bench-app) now builds + headlessly BOOTS\nthrough every tool (vite/rspack/rsbuild/rslib/rolldown/ng), all works=PASS, zero\npending (the @rspack/@rsbuild/@rslib cores are installed). Driving @Component→Ivy\nthrough real bundlers on a cross-file app for the first time (linker-smoke is\nhand-authored Ivy) surfaced + FIXED 3 genuine compiler bugs — verified to NOT\nregress (matchGolden still 185/185, swc 29/29, drift clean, treaty_ivy green):\n1. type-only import leaked into dependencies[] — an input binding [trend] folded to\n   PascalCase ''Trend'' and matched the imported TYPE; now Type imports are excluded\n   from auto-import candidates (source_compile.rs).\n2. nested-view const-pool index collision — nested @if/@for views each used a\n   separate ConstantPool from 0 and re-interned at wrong offsets → getOrCreateTNode\n   crash; now ONE shared ConstantPool across the view tree, like Angular (template.rs).\n3. @for + @empty under-allocated slots — @empty needs decls+1 and vars+1 for the\n   empty-container TNode; now allocated (template.rs).\nPlus a Windows path bug in @treaty/rspack + @treaty/rsbuild (new URL().pathname →\n/C:/... ; switched to fileURLToPath) — without it those plugins couldn''t register\nloaders on Windows at all.\n\nBench: full-app harness + jsdom boot probe (fullapp-bench.mjs, boot-fullapp.mjs).\nNumbers (best-of-3): rolldown 430ms / rslib 499ms(lib) / rspack 891ms / rsbuild\n955ms / vite 2360ms / ng 5958ms — all boot+render. i18n un-skipped in the oracle\n(parity.mjs renders $localize now; the 2 i18n fixtures differ only cosmetically in\nconst-pool local names + FFFD escaping, instruction streams byte-identical).","tree":{"sha":"e9416b07614314af95c3cae224cfaa4a860fa94d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/e9416b07614314af95c3cae224cfaa4a860fa94d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/54f5860ceccbb53937087c894178ddd64cb499c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/54f5860ceccbb53937087c894178ddd64cb499c6","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDU0ZjU4NjBjZWNjYmI1MzkzNzA4N2M4OTQxNzhkZGQ2NGNiNDk5YzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/22b60237d3104690f3fe510559dad99bd732527c","sha":"22b60237d3104690f3fe510559dad99bd732527c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/22b60237d3104690f3fe510559dad99bd732527c"}],"sha":"54f5860ceccbb53937087c894178ddd64cb499c6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/54f5860ceccbb53937087c894178ddd64cb499c6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/22b60237d3104690f3fe510559dad99bd732527c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T20:14:03Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T20:14:03Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(treaty-ivy): matchGolden 185/185 (100%) — close the 4 NgModule DIFFs\n\nReaches 100% of the runnable Angular compliance corpus (was 181/185), all mode-gated\nso the default AOT emit is byte-unchanged (swc 29/29 + drift clean + treaty_ivy green):\n- linkerJitMode threaded through CompileOptions→CompileCtx→NgModuleCompiler. When the\n  fixture requests jit mode, the NgModule selector scope uses Inline (declarations/\n  imports/exports/bootstrap folded DIRECTLY into ɵɵdefineNgModule, Angular''s\n  r3_module_compiler.ts jit shape) instead of the ɵɵsetNgModuleScope side effect.\n  This emits NO JIT runtime calls — the no-@angular/compiler guarantee holds.\n  (Restored faithful Inline-vs-SideEffect semantics; the old code wrongly collapsed\n  both to setNgModuleScope, pinned by one test which is updated.)\n- forward_refs: NgModule imports with forward refs emit `imports: () => [Mod]` arrow\n  thunk in the define call (jit mode), not in the injector.\n- all_options: fixed a genuine bug — the module type was emitted as the wrong class\n  (MyImport vs MyModule) and bootstrap (forwardRef(() => MyBootstrap)) was dropped.\n\nVerified by a fresh corpus dump + run-compliance: PASS 185 / DIFF 0 / 100.0%.","tree":{"sha":"d68268a83c42d57e8aa5dcc90b98bab4718b3c6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/d68268a83c42d57e8aa5dcc90b98bab4718b3c6d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/22b60237d3104690f3fe510559dad99bd732527c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/22b60237d3104690f3fe510559dad99bd732527c","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDIyYjYwMjM3ZDMxMDQ2OTBmM2ZlNTEwNTU5ZGFkOTliZDczMjUyN2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/6573056ff08c1518f71f4465852d3423a1b5baf1","sha":"6573056ff08c1518f71f4465852d3423a1b5baf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/6573056ff08c1518f71f4465852d3423a1b5baf1"}],"sha":"22b60237d3104690f3fe510559dad99bd732527c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/22b60237d3104690f3fe510559dad99bd732527c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/6573056ff08c1518f71f4465852d3423a1b5baf1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:42:01Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:42:01Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"fix(treaty-ivy): default changeDetection = Angular Default (omitted); OnPush is opt-in\n\nPer directive \"OnPush only with the signal modernizer; otherwise match the Angular\ndefault.\" Every authoring path now defaults to ChangeDetectionStrategy::Default\n(changeDetection OMITTED from the emit, byte-matching @angular/compiler v22):\n- compile.rs compile_component_with (the selectorless template-only / benchmark\n  compileComponent entry) was hardcoded OnPush → now Default.\n- sfc.rs (.treaty + JSX/.tsx flat path) was hardcoded OnPush → now Default (threads\n  an on_push param, false by default).\n- source_compile.rs @Component .ts already defaulted to Default; now also honors the\n  flag. An EXPLICIT @Component({changeDetection: OnPush}) still emits regardless.\nOnPush is opt-in via the new ModernizeOptions.on_push (signals mode).\n\nVerified: cargo test -p treaty_ivy 132 green (+3 new CD tests); backend-parity 29/29\n[oxc,swc] + baseline.json re-recorded (drift clean); benchmark correctness now 27/27\nEXACT vs the @angular/compiler oracle (changeDetection:0 divergence eliminated, was\n0/27); matchGolden 181/185 UNCHANGED (goldens omit changeDetection — no regression).\nlinker.rs ɵɵngDeclare OnPush-by-default (v>=22) left intact (Angular partial-link\nsemantics, not an authoring path).","tree":{"sha":"98f3a323916b46b4a3525db8ccdc18b17e43f641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/98f3a323916b46b4a3525db8ccdc18b17e43f641"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/6573056ff08c1518f71f4465852d3423a1b5baf1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/6573056ff08c1518f71f4465852d3423a1b5baf1","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDY1NzMwNTZmZjA4YzE1MThmNzFmNDQ2NTg1MmQzNDIzYTFiNWJhZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/48f105cac9670f88feee206a07e308fbd2ea3411","sha":"48f105cac9670f88feee206a07e308fbd2ea3411","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/48f105cac9670f88feee206a07e308fbd2ea3411"}],"sha":"6573056ff08c1518f71f4465852d3423a1b5baf1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/6573056ff08c1518f71f4465852d3423a1b5baf1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/48f105cac9670f88feee206a07e308fbd2ea3411/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:13:08Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T19:13:08Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(treaty-ivy): opt-in modernizer — migrate legacy Angular to signals + control flow\n\nAn opt-in compile-time modernizer (ModernizeOptions { signal_inputs, signal_outputs,\ncontrol_flow }, all default FALSE) — the default Angular-exact path is byte-unchanged\n(matchGolden 181/185 + backend-parity 29/29 [oxc,swc] verified green with it OFF):\n- @Input → signal input(): emits InputFlags.SignalBased + signals:true, alias/transform\n  preserved; lowered emit byte-matches hand-authored input().\n- *ngIf/*ngFor/[ngSwitch] → @if/@for/@switch: a pure HTML-AST→HTML-AST rewrite\n  (template/modernize.rs) feeding the EXISTING proven block control-flow pipeline —\n  lowered emit BYTE-IDENTICAL to hand-authored @if/@for/@switch (ɵɵconditional/\n  ɵɵrepeater). Refuses non-mechanical shapes (ngIf else/then refs) → keeps classic.\n- @Output → output(): verified no-op (Ivy output metadata is identical for both forms).\n- packagr .d.ts isSignal bug FIXED: classic @Input → isSignal:false + plain property;\n  signal input() → isSignal:true + InputSignal<T> (read from the emitted SignalBased bit).\n- 23 new tests (10 facade + 9 modernize HTML-AST + 4 component_dts); two hard-gate tests\n  assert modernizer-OFF == classic byte-for-byte.","tree":{"sha":"ffc5782aaf5a55a4f880e5891f58e916a677d3a8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/ffc5782aaf5a55a4f880e5891f58e916a677d3a8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/48f105cac9670f88feee206a07e308fbd2ea3411","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/r