30636701c0411de5488d7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:35:35Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:35:35Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"test(examples): add ng-bench-app — pure-Angular full-app benchmark fixture\n\nA realistic standard-Angular app (6 standalone OnPush components, 2 @Injectable\nservices with constructor DI, a @Pipe, an attribute @Directive with @HostBinding/\n@HostListener, eager + 3 lazy routes, signals/computed/effect, @if/@for/@switch,\nRxJS→signal interop) using ZERO Treaty-only features — so it compiles under BOTH\n`ng build` AND Treaty''s bundlers, the fair head-to-head fixture for the full-app\nbenchmark. Verified: Angular''s @angular/build:application builder (via Architect,\nbypassing the CLI bin''s Node-floor gate) builds it; the Treaty addon compiles all\n10 decorated files to Ivy (6 component / 1 directive / 1 pipe / 2 injectable defs,\n0 residual ɵɵngDeclare).","tree":{"sha":"993b74d75c27ed8b2cb4f543f51cb06266ae0311","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/993b74d75c27ed8b2cb4f543f51cb06266ae0311"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/3c72590676ab6e2998c30636701c0411de5488d7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_