344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/d0e5018152e2bdfd8d122e5bc469c89a5625615e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:31:35Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T18:31:35Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat(bench): correctness vs Angular + v21/v22 + e2e-of-output + packagr head-to-head\n\nEnhanced treaty-bench (+ surfaced two real output-correctness bugs to fix):\n- CORRECTNESS: Treaty-oxc Ivy is equivalent to the @angular/compiler@22 oracle on\n  27/27 renderable fixtures with ZERO lowering divergences — the ONLY diff is an\n  emitted `changeDetection: 0` field v22 now omits (a real v22-compat emit bug).\n- v21 vs v22: @angular/compiler@21.2.15 (isolated temp install) ≈ @22.0.0-rc.3,\n  both ~2k-3.2k ops/s; treaty-oxc ~9.2k ops/s (~3× faster than both).\n- e2e-of-output: each built dist is booted headlessly (jsdom) — vite/rolldown/ng-cli\n  all PASS (render, no JIT/@angular/compiler); a negative test (no ɵcmp) correctly\n  FAILs. rspack/rsbuild/rslib SKIPPED (peer cores absent — fixed in the next pass).\n- packagr: treaty-packagr vs ng-packagr@21 over the same standard-Angular lib —\n  ~21× faster, emitted Ivy ɵɵdefineComponent BYTE-EQUAL on all components; one real\n  .d.ts bug found (treaty marks a classic @Input as isSignal:true).\n- parity.mjs parameterized (makePrinter/compileWithOracle take an ngc instance) so\n  the v21 oracle can drive the same printer path.","tree":{"sha":"3ac8e456f4ee612fc498713328811b2ecb7909cf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/3ac8e456f4ee612fc498713328811b2ecb7909cf"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/d0e5018152e2bdfd8d122e5bc469c89a5625615e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/d0e5018152e2bdfd8d122e5bc469c89a5625615e","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKGQwZTUwMTgxNTJlMmJkZmQ4ZDEyMmU1YmM0NjljODlhNTYyNTYxNWU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/1874f551417f91deb44d8a4b0b717133acd12916","sha":"1874f551417f91deb44d8a4b0b717133acd12916","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/1874f551417f91deb44d8a4b0b717133acd12916"}],"sha":"d0e5018152e2bdfd8d122e5bc469c89a5625615e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/d0e5018152e2bdfd