_ssg: discovery → static Ivy interpret → hydration\n  manifest + sitemap/robots) is ✅; live request-time SSR stays 🏗️ (was conflated).\n- Tooling: \"no tsc\" was false — tsgo typechecks, but the Moon build tasks still emit\n  library JS/.d.ts via tsc; stated honestly with full-tsc-removal as a tracked goal.\n- Recorded the Nx→Moon move: the plan''s Phase-1c `nx run-many` gate is superseded by\n  the Moon move + the cargo/e2e CI gate.\n- PHASE1B-UPGRADE.md: noted the fast-follow to 22-rc.3 + the @Service linker fix.","tree":{"sha":"12016da18b77195e5e8a5dab7e8cacbb8af04877","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/12016da18b77195e5e8a5dab7e8cacbb8af04877"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/7fe3109911bc77508cd7613eebd7391b03311b20","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/7fe3109911bc77508cd7613eebd7391b03311b20","node_id":"C_kwDOLhfoE9oAKDdmZTMxMDk5MTFiYzc3NTA4Y2Q3NjEzZWViZDczOTFiMDMzMTFiMjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/treatyjs/treaty/commit/c20267a7b6e1e155cb6da0ff8579be47897d504c","sha":"c20267a7b6e1e155cb6da0ff8579be47897d504c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/c20267a7b6e1e155cb6da0ff8579be47897d504c"}],"sha":"7fe3109911bc77508cd7613eebd7391b03311b20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/7fe3109911bc77508cd7613eebd7391b03311b20"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"login":"Jordan-Hall","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIwOTIzNDQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/commits/c20267a7b6e1e155cb6da0ff8579be47897d504c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:49:20Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-02T15:49:20Z","email":"Jordan@libertyware.co.uk","name":"Jordan Upton"},"message":"feat: target Angular 22.0.0 (rc.3) + TypeScript 6.0, link the new @Service primitive\n\nBumps every pinned @angular/* + @angular-devkit/* + @angular/cli + compiler-cli +\nlanguage-service to 22.0.0-rc.3 (the 22.0.0 release line; final is not on npm yet —\nre-pin to 22.0.0 when it ships) and typescript ~5.9 -> ~6.0 (Angular 22 peer is\n>=6.0 <6.1; resolves to 6.0.3). @angular-eslint stays at 21 (no 22.x published;\noxlint is the real linter). Loose >=18/>=0.2000.0 devkit ranges left as-is. Deduped\na stray @volar/language-server.\n\nThe bump surfaced a REAL linker gap, now fixed: Angular 22 introduces the @Service\nDI primitive (FactoryTarget.Service = 5, ɵɵngDeclareService -> ɵɵdefineService).\ntreaty_ivy_core already had compile_service + the R3::DefineService/DeclareService\nidentifiers, but the partial-declaration linker mapped neither the \"Service\"\nfactory-target string nor the ɵɵngDeclareService declare kind, so real v22\n@angular/{common,platform-browser,forms,router,animations} failed to link. Added\nthe FactoryTarget::Service mapping, a DeclareKind::Service, and link_service\n(toR3ServiceMeta -> ɵɵdefineService).\n\nVerified: all 12 link_real_packages integration tests link the freshly-installed\nreal @angular@22.0.0-rc.3 (+ CDK/Material) to ZERO residual ɵɵngDeclare; 104 facade\nunit tests green incl. a new links_service_declaration.","tree":{"sha":"9b3ac83b9c35c451a07908ed42919f2bcdce3641","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/trees/9b3ac83b9c35c451a07908ed42919f2bcdce3641"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/treatyjs/treaty/git/commits/c20267a7b6e1e155cb6da0ff8579be47897d504c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2092344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jordan-Hall/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jordan-Hall","id":2092344,"logi