ents{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/80c634937d43a4d7e220a0f211a0ccf37d0c8f64/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:18:54Z","email":"rafi.adnan@optimizely.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:24:18Z","email":"rafiadnan47@gmail.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"message":"fix(react): fall back to 1rem when --ax-styles-scale is undefined\n\nWhen a newer @optiaxiom/react renders under a ThemeProvider from a release before #1792, nothing defines --ax-styles-scale. Every rem() size then resolves to an invalid calc(), which collapses spacing, sizes and radii to their initial values.\n\nvar(--ax-styles-scale, 1rem) keeps those sizes at their plain rem values, matching the fallback MaterialIcon already uses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"51393bd2a63532780e38af9fdffa71e503f9d77d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/51393bd2a63532780e38af9fdffa71e503f9d77d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/80c634937d43a4d7e220a0f211a0ccf37d0c8f64","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned