2:21Z","email":"rafiadnan47@gmail.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"message":"feat(react): add size prop to Checkbox\n\nAdds `size=\"sm\" | \"md\"` (default `md`). md keeps the existing 24px control, which takes 20px of layout to match the `md` line-height. sm is a 20px control that takes 16px of layout and pairs with the `sm` font size token, so the label and description text scale with it. The sm label uses regular weight.\n\nThe checked-state border and contrast outline are derived from the control size so both sizes fill correctly.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"079f6a6d227990ed12391fb2fe5caf9fc8a21295","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/079f6a6d227990ed12391fb2fe5caf9fc8a21295"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/4ea92fb0c926dcd1703fa74ef85c8c51302c312a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/4ea92fb0c926d