rigger content\n\nFollow-up to #1802, which centered `Button` content by default. The date range picker trigger reads like a form input, so its calendar icon and value should sit at the start when the trigger is stretched. Consumers can still override with `justifyContent`.\n\nThe existing `Addons` story stretches the trigger and covers this in Chromatic.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ead0629d6b9999336037fa178016642afff6d68","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/1ead0629d6b9999336037fa178016642afff6d68"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/2dddb22139cae6314ad5f9d4fd53b5a8603d8d71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/2dddb22139cae6314ad5f9d4fd53b5a8603d8d71","node_id":"C_kwDOLmk80NoAKDJkZGRiMjIxMzljYWU2MzE0YWQ1ZjlkNGZkNTNiNWE4NjAzZDhkNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiax