committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:01:13Z","email":"rafiadnan47@gmail.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"message":"fix(react): scale layout sizes with root font size\n\nFixed widths and remaining sizing were px while content inside them scaled: dialog, alert dialog and menu dialog widths and gutters, sub nav, breadcrumb and data table footer widths, calendar grid and day markers, progress height, avatar font sizes and group overlaps, card preview spacing, indicator offsets, toast viewport margins, resizable handle hit area, modal listbox minimum width and rich text editor spacing. They now go through rem().\n\nMotion distances, the toast hover gap (tied to its JS stacking math) and Kbd (em-based) stay as they were.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"45ebf088163695c2487c8272dc91c0911b3b0fa2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/45ebf088163695c2487c8272dc91c0911b3b0fa2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/be6bc4f551909082b89bbc67154d2727ccd01e16","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radn