nan"},"message":"fix(react): scale button, tabs and pill spacing with root font size\n\nButton padding, icon button width, tab padding and gaps, and pill menu padding were px inside rem-sized controls, so at non-16px roots the controls kept full-size padding around scaled text. They now go through rem(). The opal ring and tab underline widths stay px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7258de62e13998fde04098aac907e9b298b2cb29","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/7258de62e13998fde04098aac907e9b298b2cb29"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/3253285195843cb524ab423640547dc297731cb7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/3253285195843cb524ab423640547dc297731cb7","node_id":"C_kwDOLmk80NoAKDMyNTMyODUxOTU4NDNjYjUyNGFiNDIzNjQwNTQ3ZGMyOTc3MzFjYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/3dd6bdcdb6de3ce78ed7e02b1478c7719121c280","sha":"3dd6bdcdb6de3ce78ed7e02b1478c7719121c280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/3dd6bdcdb6de3ce78ed7e02b1478c7719121c280"}],"sha":"3253285195843cb524ab423640547dc297731cb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/3253285195843cb524ab423640547dc297731cb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/3dd6bdcdb6de3ce78ed7e02b1478c7719121c280/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:08:00Z","email":"rafi.adnan@optimizely.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:01:13Z","email":"rafiadnan47@gmail.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"message":"fix: scale icon sizes with root font size\n\nIcons ignored the root font size: react''s internal icons (checkbox tick, data table sort, Opal) were sized by SVG width/height attributes, and @optiaxiom/icons fell back to a fixed 20px outside of buttons while its size tokens were plain rem. At non-16px roots icons stayed full size inside scaled controls.\n\n- withIcon sets its size through rem(), keeping any style passed in.\n- MaterialIcon''s default size and size tokens resolve through --ax-styles-scale. Numeric sizes stay px since the caller chose them.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"01572d25a242259f37fb393a7d715942448199b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/01572d25a242259f37fb393a7d715942448199b4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/3dd6bdcdb6de3ce78ed7e02b1478c7719121c280","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/3dd6bdcdb6de3ce78ed7e02b1478c7719121c280","node_id":"C_kwDOLmk80NoAKDNkZDZiZGNkYjZkZTNjZTc4ZWQ3ZTAyYjE0NzhjNzcxOTEyMWMyODA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/1a1206641c8f3f84579596a5c37e81c5038f4826","sha":"1a1206641c8f3f84579596a5c37e81c5038f4826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/1a1206641c8f3f84579596a5c37e81c5038f4826"}],"sha":"3dd6bdcdb6de3ce78ed7e02b1478c7719121c280","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/3dd6bdcdb6de3ce78ed7e02b1478c7719121c280"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/1a1206641c8f3f84579596a5c37e81c5038f4826/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:05:45Z","email":"rafi.adnan@optimizely.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:01:13Z","email":"rafiadnan47@gmail.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"message":"fix(react): scale form control sizes with root font size\n\nCheckbox, Radio, Switch, Range and Listbox mixed px sizes into rem layouts: the checked-state fill borders, hit areas, indicator dots, switch padding, range track and thumb, and listbox item heights. On pages with a non-16px root font size these stayed full size while everything around them scaled, so controls rendered oversized or misaligned.\n\nThey now go through rem() and follow --ax-styles-scale. Border widths and focus rings stay px.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3ab514a8ac03680d181b24fd27175328b22baf58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/3ab514a8ac03680d181b24fd27175328b22baf58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/1a1206641c8f3f84579596a5c37e81c5038f4826","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/1a1206641c8f3f84579596a5c37e81c5038f4826","node_id":"C_kwDOLmk80NoAKDFhMTIwNjY0MWM4ZjNmODQ1Nzk1OTZhNWMzN2U4MWM1MDM4ZjQ4MjY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/d19230069af938bec139ac70040eb6a9cedf167c","sha":"d19230069af938bec139ac70040eb6a9cedf167c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/d19230069af938bec139ac70040eb6a9cedf167c"}],"sha":"1a1206641c8f3f84579596a5c37e81c5038f4826","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/1a1206641c8f3f84579596a5c37e81c5038f4826"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/d19230069af938bec139ac70040eb6a9cedf167c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T16:01:58Z","email":"rafi.adnan@optimizely.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T18:01:13Z","email":"rafiadnan47@gmail.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"message":"feat(react): add --ax-styles-scale to decouple sizing from root font size\n\nrem-based sizes follow the page''s root font size, which is right for apps (it honours the user''s browser font size) but wrong when Axiom is embedded in pages we don''t control, like the Visual Editor''s shadow root on customer sites with html { font-size: 10px }.\n\nEvery rem value now resolves through calc(n * var(--ax-styles-scale)), and ThemeProvider defines --ax-styles-scale: 1rem alongside the theme vars, so nothing changes by default. Embedders set it on the same :root/:host as the theme, e.g. --ax-styles-scale: max(1rem, 16px) to stop host pages from shrinking Axiom while still growing with the user''s browser font size.\n\n- rem() in utils accepts px or rem and passes other values through; sprinkles, component styles and ThemeProvider use it.\n- tokens keep their plain rem values; ThemeProvider scales them when writing the theme vars.\n- screens stay plain rem because media queries can''t read custom properties.\n- ThemeProvider stories cover default, small and large root font sizes, and the recommended embedder scale.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e458b7e3e968012766b9494e7dc055dbafa243e8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/e458b7e3e968012766b9494e7dc055dbafa243e8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/d19230069af938bec139ac70040eb6a9cedf167c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commit/d19230069af938bec139ac70040eb6a9cedf167c","node_id":"C_kwDOLmk80NoAKGQxOTIzMDA2OWFmOTM4YmVjMTM5YWM3MDA0MG