,"name":"Abu Jafar Saifullah Mahin"},"message":"fix(react): refine overlay trigger open-state per review\n\n- use the hover fill (not pressed) for the open state, so selecting an item\n  doesn''t drop a deep fill while the label changes\n- keep the open state out of :active so clicking an open trigger to close it\n  still shows pressed feedback\n- give open its own selector instead of folding it into the active/on group,\n  so an open trigger no longer reads as a toggled-on ToggleButton\n- add an open state to the strong variant (primary/danger/inverse), with a\n  borderColor fallback so the 2px danger/inverse border reads as fill, not a ring\n- emit data-state on SelectTrigger (downshift only sets aria-expanded) so Select\n  highlights like Menu\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a341a6eae50348e7f5700493172eba64dd24a6f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/4a341a6eae50348e7f5700493172eba64dd24a6f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/commits/df468d031cc1cf3aa5b9bea185ee9757a8b80aa9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/162153227?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaf107/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaf107/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaf107/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaf107/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jaf107","id":162153227,"login":"jaf107","node_id":"U_kgDOCapDCw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaf107/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaf107/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaf107/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jaf107/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_