"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/1a1d3cab8cd19428982155dddd86cb2cdbee6b50/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:52:33Z","email":"rafi.adnan@optimizely.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:56:49Z","email":"rafiadnan47@gmail.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"message":"feat(docs): add an avatar card icon\n\nNothing could link to Avatar because it had no registry entry, and no\nexisting icon fitted. Rendering the real component is already the\nconvention for the small self-contained ones — Checkbox, Switch, Radio,\nSpinner and Progress all do it — so Avatar follows suit rather than\ngetting a mock built out of IconBox.\n\nA two-word name so the fallback shows two initials rather than a lone\nletter, and the default colour scheme.\n\nIndicator links to it: \"a badge at the corner of another element\" is\ndescribing the avatar status dot.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0bd22962007c236f03d426cff83a37169b4bcf45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/git/trees/0bd22962007c236f03d