llowers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/cc2b453233eb6ee956302a96578e4ffff0970516/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:40:51Z","email":"rafi.adnan@optimizely.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T15:56:49Z","email":"rafiadnan47@gmail.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"message":"feat(docs): add related cards to the remaining component pages\n\nFifteen component pages had no related section at all, so each was a\ndead end — you could arrive but the docs would not tell you what sits\nnext to it. Wire each to the components it is actually an alternative\nto, or is used with, taking the pairing from what the page itself says\nrather than from what the names suggest.\n\nModalLayer now points at the nested overlays guide, which is written\nabout exactly the case its intro describes. The two date components\npoint at each other, as do Sidebar and Breadcrumb.\n\nAdds DateInput, DateRangePicker and Breadcrumb to the registry so they\ncan be linked at all; each reuses an existing icon.\n\nCard is left alone: a generic container has no natural sibling, and\nCardLink already covers the one link that suggested itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":