.com/u/758244?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/radnan","id":758244,"login":"radnan","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1ODI0NA==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/radnan","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/optimizely-axiom/optiaxiom/commits/04f3228ae7e22a0dbbf4d00244769b11d5cc1b02/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T18:00:44Z","email":"rafi.adnan@optimizely.com","name":"Rafi Adnan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T15:40:56Z","email":"engr.tanvir.islam.1@gmail.com","name":"Tanvir Islam Streame"},"message":"feat(proteus): disable actions while an interaction is pending\n\nAction loading state was local to each button, so a document with a\nconfirm/cancel pair let the user click \"Cancel\" while \"Delete\" was still\nin flight (and the other way around). Track the pending action''s id on\nthe document context instead: the firing action keeps its spinner and\nevery other action in the document is disabled until the event settles.\n\nThe dispatch is now wrapped in try/finally, so a rejected interaction\nreleases the document instead of leaving the buttons stuck.\n\nAdds a WithAsyncActions story with a slow interaction and a play test\nasserting the sibling action is disabled while one is in flight and\nre-enables once it settles.\n\nCloses OPAL-6356\n\nCo-A